# Canonical fixture: Chain-space lace motif (8-fold loops)
title: Chain-space lace motif (8-fold loops)
terms: US
yarn: crochet cotton no. 10
hook: 1.5mm
params: thread-10_1.5mm
source: original (project fixture)
license: CC0-1.0

Rnd 1: mr, ch 1, 8 sc in ring, join. (8)
Rnd 2: ch 1, sc in same st, ch 3, *sc in next st, ch 3* x7, join. (8 sc, 8 ch-3 sps)
Rnd 3: sl st in next ch-3 sp, ch 1, sc in same sp, ch 5, *sc in next ch-3 sp, ch 5* x7, join. (8 sc, 8 ch-5 sps)
Rnd 4: sl st in next ch-5 sp, ch 1, (sc, ch 3, sc) in same sp, ch 5, *(sc, ch 3, sc) in next ch-5 sp, ch 5* x7, join, fasten off. (16 sc, 8 ch-3 sps, 8 ch-5 sps)
